WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.867
"Today, you are going to the doctor."

2
00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:13.754
"But I'm not sick, Mom."

3
00:00:13.755 --> 00:00:15.962
"You need a checkup."

4
00:00:15.963 --> 00:00:19.421
"Mom, what is a checkup?"

5
00:00:19.422 --> 00:00:21.805
"The doctor looks at you.

6
00:00:21.806 --> 00:00:25.627
He checks that you are healthy."

7
00:00:25.628 --> 00:00:28.889
"Will it be hard?"

8
00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:32.769
"No, it will be easy."

9
00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:40.350
"Oh, I don't know."

10
00:00:40.351 --> 00:00:43.622
"Stick out your tongue, Richard."

11
00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:52.703
"That’s easy. I can stick out my tongue."

12
00:00:52.704 --> 00:00:55.365
"Pull up your shirt."

13
00:00:55.366 --> 00:01:04.869
"That’s too easy. I can pull up my shirt."

14
00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:08.284
"Now, Richard, can you touch your toes?"

15
00:01:08.285 --> 00:01:15.889
"No problem. I can touch my toes."

16
00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:17.788
"Turn your head, Richard.

17
00:01:17.789 --> 00:01:20.329
I will look into your ear."

18
00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:29.447
"That’s easy for me. I can turn my head."

19
00:01:29.448 --> 00:01:32.175
"Richard, let's see how much you weigh.

20
00:01:32.176 --> 00:01:34.625
Stand on the scales."

21
00:01:34.626 --> 00:01:44.554
"That's really easy. I can stand on the scales."

22
00:01:44.555 --> 00:01:48.867
"How tall are you, Richard? Stand up tall."

23
00:01:48.868 --> 00:01:58.544
"I can stand up tall. Look at me."

24
00:01:58.545 --> 00:02:01.298
"Now I will check your eyes.

25
00:02:01.299 --> 00:02:03.683
Please, look into this light."

26
00:02:03.684 --> 00:02:06.849
"Okay. I can look at the light.

27
00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:14.238
A checkup is very easy."

28
00:02:14.239 --> 00:02:16.940
"Richard, can you roll up your sleeve?"

29
00:02:16.941 --> 00:02:26.340
"Ha-ha! I can roll up my sleeve. That's easy too."

30
00:02:26.341 --> 00:02:29.367
"Ouch! Ouch!"

31
00:02:29.368 --> 00:02:33.883
"Finished! That was easy for you, Richard."

32
00:02:33.884 --> 00:02:39.367
"I don't know. Ouch."

